    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3111</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3400004c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どこまで逃げるつもりだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Até quando pretende
continuar fugindo?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3133</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3400004d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>このトーマ、
あまり気の長い方ではない。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não tenho muita
paciência agora.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3164</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3400004e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>これ以上、わずらわせるなら、
命の保証はできんぞ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Se continuar a ser um espinho no
meu pé, não garanto que
será poupado.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3201</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3400004f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……俺の命にかえても、
妻と娘は守ってみせる!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Vou proteger minha esposa e minha
filha, mesmo que custe a vida!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3232</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>34000050</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>その覚悟や良し。だが!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sua determinação é admirável.
Porém...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3369</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>34000051</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ぐああああぁぁぁぁぁッ……！
ナ、ナイラ……&lt;Hilda&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Guaaahh!! N-Nayla... &lt;Hilda&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3443</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>34000052</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>お父さん!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pai!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>34000053</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あなた!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Q-Querido!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Name</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3586</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>34000054</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やめて!!　どうして!!
どうしてこんな事をするの!!
娘を……娘を返して!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pare! Por que está fazendo
isso?! Devolva-a! Devolva
minha filha!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3608</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>34000055</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>消えろ……
同じガジュマとして、
せめてもの情けだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Suma daqui. Terei piedade, já que
somos ambos Gajuma.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3658</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>34000056</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いや……
いやぁぁぁぁぁぁぁッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não... NÃÃÃO!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s1-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1344</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000015</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>「迷いの森」か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A Floresta Labirinto, hein...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1376</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200000c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ねえ、なんだか同じところを
グルグルと回ってる気がしない……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Só eu sinto, ou parece que
estamos andando em
círculos?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1405</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200000d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……おそらく、
ここは「迷いの森」だろう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Esta deve ser a
Floresta Labirinto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1448</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200000e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>迷いの森？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Floresta Labirinto?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1469</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200000f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うかつに踏み込めば、
方向を見失って出られなくなると
聞いた事がある。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Quem entra sem preparo se perde
e fica preso no labirinto para
sempre. Ou é o que dizem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1497</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000010</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>出られなくなったら
ボクたちどうなっちゃうの……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Se a gente não conseguir sair,
o que vai ser de nós...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1526</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000011</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>永遠に森の中を
さまようしかないだろうな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Vamos vagar por estes bosques
para toda a eternidade, suponho.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1555</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000012</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うそー!?
そんなのボク、ヤだヨー!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O quê!? Tomara que seja piada!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1609</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000013</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここを抜ける方法は？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Como saímos daqui?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1638</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000014</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>残念だが、俺は知らない。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Receio que eu não saiba.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1680</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000016</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうしよう？
ここを抜けないかぎり、
ペトナジャンカへは行けないよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>E agora? Nunca vamos chegar a
Petnadjanka se não acharmos
a saída daqui.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1725</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000017</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく進むしかない。行こう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Só nos resta continuar.
Vamos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1841</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000018</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そっちはダメ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Essa não é a saída.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1935</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000019</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>道はこっちしかないよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas é a única direção que
o caminho segue...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1957</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200001a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そっちへ進んでも迷うだけ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Por ali você só vai
se perder.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1978</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200001b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この森の抜け方を知っているのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você conhece esta floresta?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200001c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どこいくの&lt;Annie&gt;？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aonde você vai, &lt;Annie&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2117</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200001d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>正しい道はこっち。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Para o caminho certo,
que é aqui.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2204</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200001e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここって、
ただの草むらなんですけど？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tenho quase certeza de que
isso é só um arbusto...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2284</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200001f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mao&gt;、フォルスで
そこの草むらを焼くんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mao&gt;, queime com seu Force.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2319</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000020</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、そっか……
うん、わかった。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, tá... Acho que entendi.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2545</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000021</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こんなところに道が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um caminho escondido...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2583</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000022</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>昔、まだ人がここに住んでいた頃、
外部の侵入者を防ぐために、
自然を利用して迷路を作ったそうです。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Antigamente, pessoas viviam nesta
floresta. Usaram as plantas ao
redor para criar um labirinto e
afastar intrusos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2604</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000023</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へえ、よく知ってるね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uau, como você sabe tudo isso?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2634</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000024</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>お父さんについて医者の勉強をしてた頃、
よくこの森に薬草を採りに来た事が
あったから。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Quando eu estudava medicina com
meu pai, vínhamos sempre aqui
colher ervas medicinais.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2662</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000025</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へー、&lt;Annie&gt;ってお医者さん
目指してるんだね♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh, então a &lt;Annie&gt; quer
ser médica♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2683</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000026</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2705</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000027</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>迷路の仕掛けは他にもあるって
聞いてます。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ouvi dizer que há armadilhas
escondidas no labirinto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2754</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000028</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうか……気をつけて進もう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Entendo... Devemos nos
mover com cuidado.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>-1</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>[VARIABLE]</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>[VARIABLE]</EnglishText>
      <Notes>DON'T EDIT THIS, IT'S A DUMMY ENTRY</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s1-1</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3800</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;このエリアのバイラスは、
味方キャラクターの
ラッシュゲージが一定以下の時、
自動的に防御をしてきます。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Os inimigos daqui se defendem
quando atacados por aliados com RG
abaixo de certo limite.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;ラッシュチャージを行ったり、
他の味方の連携に加わるなどして、
防御されにくい作戦を取りましょう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Nesse caso, aumente seu RG Gauge e
coopere com os aliados para
quebrar a defesa do inimigo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;また、&lt;Red&gt;料理&lt;Green&gt;には戦闘開始時の
ラッシュゲージを上げる料理が
あります。うまく利用して下さい。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Há também &lt;Red&gt;receitas&lt;Green&gt; que aumentam
seu Rush Gauge no início da
batalha. Use-as com sabedoria.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s1-2</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>840</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000008</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>同じところをグルグル回ってるよー!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Estamos andando em círculos!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>861</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000009</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おそらくここは「迷いの森」だ。
うかつに踏み込むと出られなくなる。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Esta deve ser a Floresta Labirinto.
Dizem que quem entra sem preparo
pode ficar perdido para sempre.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>882</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200000a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>逆方向へ来ちゃったんだよ、
ミナールは森を出て北東の方角だヨ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Voltamos ao ponto de partida;
Minal fica a nordeste quando
sairmos da floresta!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>903</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200000b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Annie&gt;を早く医者に診せなければ……
……急ごう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Temos que levar a &lt;Annie&gt; ao
médico... Vamos depressa!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>927</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000000</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>同じところをグルグル回ってるみたいだね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Parece que estamos
andando em círculos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>964</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000001</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうか……
おそらくここは「迷いの森」だろう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Entendo... Este lugar deve ser
a Floresta Labirinto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000002</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>迷いの森？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Floresta Labirinto?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1013</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000003</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うかつに踏み込めば、
方向を見失って出られなくなると
聞いた事がある。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Quem entra sem preparo se perde
e fica preso no labirinto para
sempre. Ou é o que dizem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1034</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000004</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここを抜ける方法は？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Como saímos daqui?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1063</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000005</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>残念だが俺は知らない。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lamento dizer,
mas não sei.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1091</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000006</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うーん……どうしよっか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hum... O que vamos fazer?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>58</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1112</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000007</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今の目的地はミナールだ。
無理に迷いの森に入る必要はない。
引き返して、ミナールへ向かおう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Estamos indo para Minal. Não
precisamos perder tempo com a
Floresta Labirinto. Vamos voltar
e seguir até lá.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>59</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
